## Output
Return one JSON object: {"triples": [...]}, each with the keys evidence, subject, predicate, object, source_id. Return {"triples": []} when nothing relevant is stated.

Example of the shape (illustrative values):
{"triples": [{"evidence": "our method improves accuracy by 4.2 points on GSM8K", "subject": "p12", "predicate": "improves accuracy on", "object": "GSM8K by 4.2 points", "source_id": "p12-results-3"}]}
